meSpeak — eSpeak text-to-speech compiled to JavaScript
------------------------------------------------------
mespeak.js is meSpeak v1.9.6 by Norbert Landsteiner (www.masswerk.at/mespeak),
a mod of speak.js (github.com/kripken/speak.js), which is eSpeak compiled with
Emscripten. Taken from the npm package mespeak@2.0.2 and bundled into one
browser file by scripts/vendor-mespeak.js, unchanged otherwise.
mespeak_config.json is the engine's data; en-us.json is the American English
voice, both from the same package.

